       "text": "I haven't entered this order because the dose looks unsafe.\n\n- **Dose per administration:** 1600 mg is double the usual maximum single dose of ibuprofen, which is 800 mg.\n- **Total daily dose:** 1600 mg four times daily is 6,400 mg/day. The maximum is 3,200 mg/day for prescription use in adults, and that is already the upper limit. At 6,400 mg/day the risks of GI bleeding, kidney injury, and cardiovascular events go up sharply.\n\nYou may have meant one of these:\n- 400 mg four times daily (1,600 mg/day)\n- 800 mg three times daily (2,400 mg/day)\n- 800 mg four times daily (3,200 mg/day, the maximum)\n\nTell me the dose and frequency you want and I'll enter it right away. If you do want 1600 mg four times daily, please confirm that it's intended and give me the clinical rationale. I'd also suggest checking with pharmacy before it goes in."
